295
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:01,140
I'll never forgive you, Tia!

296
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:04,240
My people didn't deserve any of this!

297
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:06,913
There's nothing to gain from slaying us!

298
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:09,920
The person you're seeking isn't here!

299
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:13,537
How much of a thousand-year
history must you

300
00:18:13,620 --> 00:18:16,740
do to destroy before your
bloodlust is satisfied?

301
00:18:32,980 --> 00:18:34,060
Wanda, stop!

302
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:35,401
Don't hurt them!

303
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:36,660
They saved me!

304
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,320
Huh? Tristan?

305
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:40,660
Jack's men left already! Please!

306
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:42,174
They aren't with them!

307
00:18:43,220 --> 00:18:44,157
They left?

308
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,160
You're sure?

309
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:53,540
pedro wanda they didn't come
here to fight their allies

310
00:18:57,180 --> 00:19:00,517
using strange magic they
cleared out the poison

311
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:05,257
we are indebted to them
i didn't notice but

312
00:19:05,340 --> 00:19:10,977
the smog is gone what
are your names tell me

313
00:19:11,060 --> 00:19:15,220
what are you doing let's
go chopper I'm serious.

314
00:19:15,540 --> 00:19:18,117
Look, it's been at least
a day since the attack.

315
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:22,237
To counteract the poison, they need
to have the antidote by 48 hours!

316
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:24,660
Or else they'll all die! What's that?

317
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:29,977
If we're gonna save everyone in the
country, we don't have a second to spare!

318
00:19:30,060 --> 00:19:31,295
Where's the hospital?

319
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:33,224
I need more supplies right now!

320
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:35,857
Gather anyone who's well enough to assist!

321
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:37,320
Sure. I'm a nurse.

322
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:38,420
I can help too.

323
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:41,790
If...

324
00:19:41,873 --> 00:19:42,703
you do...

325
00:19:42,786 --> 00:19:43,740
want the help?

326
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:45,230
Yes.

327
00:19:45,313 --> 00:19:49,080
I was afraid that everybody would die.

328
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:51,200
I promise, they won't.

329
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:04,506
We'll need your help, though.

330
00:20:05,700 --> 00:20:07,700
There, you'll feel better shortly.

331
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:16,020
Try those eyes!

332
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,494
Let's get you workin'!

333
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,230
U .T.

334
00:20:29,313 --> 00:20:30,513
saved our civilization.

335
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:35,120
Even though we were strangers.

336
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:40,700
We will never forget the
compassion you've shown.

337
00:20:41,080 --> 00:20:43,680
We will repay U .T. someday! Please!

338
00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:57,217
No need I can't believe
things are that tire that's

339
00:20:57,300 --> 00:21:00,560
why you were welcoming
toward us it makes sense now

340
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:08,137
Damn it that Jack jerk makes
me so mad someday I'm gonna

341
00:21:08,220 --> 00:21:13,140
whoop him and Kaido too They
mentioned that he's dead already.

342
00:21:14,060 --> 00:21:14,997
I'm not sure.

343
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:16,797
It's hard to believe that's true.

344
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:19,351
Especially if Yutia had seen his strength.

345
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:22,640
Keep talking, but I gotta go.

346
00:21:23,340 --> 00:21:25,600
Have something to do? What's up?

347
00:21:25,820 --> 00:21:28,940
Now that the sun's down,
time for the night shift.

348
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:31,866
I need to examine Cat
Viper and the Guardians.

349
00:21:32,360 --> 00:21:33,190
Right.

350
00:21:33,273 --> 00:21:34,103
Let's go by Warnie.

351
00:21:35,420 --> 00:21:37,200
By the way, Wanda, it's late.

352
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:38,717
Aren't you tired yet?

353
00:21:38,800 --> 00:21:39,630
