354
00:21:39,860 --> 00:21:41,740
After all, I am a king's bird.

355
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:43,320
A king's bird?

356
00:21:43,900 --> 00:21:44,730
Yes,

357
00:21:44,813 --> 00:21:46,677
I have a special position
in which I act as

358
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:48,997
