363
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:01,830
I'm coming!

364
00:22:01,940 --> 00:22:02,999
Let's go meet him!

365
00:22:03,140 --> 00:22:04,037
It sounds cool!

366
00:22:04,120 --> 00:22:05,920
Ah, yes, I shall go, too.

367
00:22:06,220 --> 00:22:09,500
I am quite fond of the
fellow to Master Cat Viper.

368
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:17,969
I see it's a full moon tonight, but
fortunately for us, the clouds are thick.

369
00:22:18,140 --> 00:22:20,200
Have a safe trip. Later.

370
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:23,157
Thanks for making time to
give us a ride, Carrot.

371
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:24,070
No biggie.

372
00:22:24,153 --> 00:22:25,745
Besides, I'm a king bird, too.

373
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:32,237
Anyway, Wanda, you weren't done
