374
00:22:32,320 --> 00:22:33,150
Oh, yeah.

375
00:22:33,233 --> 00:22:37,318
We never found out where that dumbass
cook and gas he scurried off to.

376
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:39,951
Perhaps I am better suited to finish this.

377
00:22:44,740 --> 00:22:45,920
To put it frankly,

378
