385
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:16,177
But I fear our dear friend Sanji
may never return to our side, huh?

386
00:23:16,260 --> 00:23:17,997
You're kidding me, right?

387
00:23:18,080 --> 00:23:19,157
Why Brook?

388
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:20,717
What kind of crap is that?

389
00:23:20,800 --> 00:23:23,997
He said in his letter that he would
come back; we warned you this.

390
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:25,897
The situation's pretty complicated.

391
00:23:25,980 --> 00:23:26,937
He wouldn't lie to us!

392
00:23:27,020 --> 00:23:29,080
I believe Sanji, end of story!

393
00:23:31,040 --> 00:23:32,620
All right, all right.

394
00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:34,212
Now take it easy, Luffy.

395
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:36,793
Allow me to catch you up to the present.

396
00:23:38,760 --> 00:23:41,960
As you know, Zo is known
as a Phantom Island.

397
00:23:42,320 --> 00:23:44,557
It's a living creature,
always on the move,

398
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:47,097
