find it with a Log Pose,

399
00:23:47,180 --> 00:23:48,940
much less locate it on a map.

400
00:23:50,820 --> 00:23:51,650
However,

401
00:23:51,733 --> 00:23:54,357
we made a mistake and failed
to take one thing into account

402
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:57,657
as we were dodging the enemy

403
00:23:57,740 --> 00:24:03,957
ship we gave

404
00:24:04,040 --> 00:24:04,937
them vital info

405
00:24:05,020 --> 00:24:08,617
how could we escape when they
knew where we were going next

406
00:24:08,700 --> 00:24:13,500
and unluckily someone from this
phantom island was aboard the

407
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,030
