408
00:24:16,113 --> 00:24:17,440
Long story short,

409
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:23,120
the people who followed us
here two days ago were the big

410
00:24:29,260 --> 00:24:30,437
mom pirates.

411
00:24:30,520 --> 00:24:31,377
We're here.

412
00:24:31,460 --> 00:24:32,620
You got it.

413
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:35,057
You can count on us, mama.

414
00:24:35,140 --> 00:24:36,669
Us two should be more than

415
00:24:38,320 --> 00:24:39,150
enough.

416
00:24:39,233 --> 00:24:41,680
So is my homeland after all. Get out!
